# 🛍️ FAQ SCHEMA + COLLECTION-FILTTERIT - SHOPIFY VALMIS

## 1️⃣ **Monikielinen FAQ Schema.org** - theme.liquid <head>

```liquid
{% assign lang = localization.language.iso_code | downcase %}

{% capture faq_json %}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Mitä 510-yhteensopivuus tarkoittaa?{% when 'ru' %}Что означает совместимость 510?{% else %}What does 510 compatibility mean?{% endcase %}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Se tarkoittaa universaalia kierteistandardia, joka mahdollistaa yhteensopivuuden useiden laitteiden ja patruunoiden välillä.{% when 'ru' %}Это универсальный стандарт резьбы, обеспечивающий совместимость многих устройств и картриджей.{% else %}It's a universal thread standard that enables compatibility across many devices and cartridges.{% endcase %}"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Kuinka nopeasti toimitatte EU-alueelle?{% when 'ru' %}Как быстро вы доставляете по ЕС?{% else %}How fast is EU shipping?{% endcase %}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Tyypillisesti 2–5 arkipäivää. Näytämme kassalla ja tilausseurannassa maakohtaiset SLA-ajat.{% when 'ru' %}Обычно 2–5 рабочих дней. На кассе и в трекинге показываем сроки по странам.{% else %}Typically 2–5 business days. We show country-specific SLAs at checkout and in order tracking.{% endcase %}"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Oletteko valtuutettu jälleenmyyjä?{% when 'ru' %}Вы — авторизованный ритейлер?{% else %}Are you an authorised retailer?{% endcase %}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Kyllä. Olemme valtuutettu jälleenmyyjä ja kuratoimme vain luotettujen kumppanibrändien tuotteita.{% when 'ru' %}Да. Мы — авторизованный ритейлер и предлагаем товары только проверенных партнёрских брендов.{% else %}Yes. We're an authorised retailer and only carry products from trusted partner brands.{% endcase %}"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Miten palautukset ja takuu toimivat?{% when 'ru' %}Как работают возвраты и гарантия?{% else %}How do returns and warranty work?{% endcase %}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Tarjoamme 30 päivän palautusoikeuden ja EU-yhteensopivan takuun. Katso sivut Palautukset ja Takuu.{% when 'ru' %}Мы предоставляем 30-дневный возврат и гарантию в соответствии с нормами ЕС. См. страницы Возвраты и Гарантия.{% else %}We offer 30‑day returns and EU‑compliant warranty. See Returns and Warranty pages.{% endcase %}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endcapture %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ faq_json | strip }}
</script>
```

## 2️⃣ **Monikieliset Collection-filtterit** - collection.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %} Monikielinen filtteripalkki wellness-poluilla {% endcomment %}
{% assign lang = localization.language.iso_code | downcase %}

<nav class="collection-filters" aria-label="Filters">
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/collections/all/focus"
         aria-current="{% if current_tags contains 'focus' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
        {% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Focus & Energy{% when 'ru' %}Фокус и энергия{% else %}Focus & Energy{% endcase %}
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/collections/all/calm"
         aria-current="{% if current_tags contains 'calm' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
        {% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Calm & Balance{% when 'ru' %}Спокойствие и баланс{% else %}Calm & Balance{% endcase %}
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/collections/all/sleep"
         aria-current="{% if current_tags contains 'sleep' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
        {% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Sleep & Recovery{% when 'ru' %}Сон и восстановление{% else %}Sleep & Recovery{% endcase %}
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/collections/all/accessories"
         aria-current="{% if current_tags contains 'accessories' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
        {% case lang %}{% when 'fi' %}Botanical Accessories{% when 'ru' %}Ботанические аксессуары{% else %}Botanical Accessories{% endcase %}
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</nav>

{% comment %}
Tuotelistauksessa näytä vain valitun tagin tuotteet, jos tagi on valittu.
Shopifyn /collections/all/<tag> reitti tekee filtteröinnin, mutta jos haluat fallbackin:
{% endcomment %}

{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}
  <div class="product-grid">
    {% for product in collection.products %}
      {% assign tags = product.tags | join: ',' | downcase %}
      {% if current_tags == blank or tags contains current_tags.first %}
        {% comment %} Render ProductCard tässä {% endcomment %}
        {% include 'product-card', product: product %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {{ paginate | default_pagination }}
{% endpaginate %}
```

## 3️⃣ **OG-locale ja Canonical** - theme.liquid <head>

```liquid
{% assign og_locale = localization.language.iso_code | downcase %}
{% if og_locale == 'en' %}{% assign og_locale = 'en_US' %}{% endif %}
<meta property="og:locale" content="{{ og_locale }}" />
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}" />
```

## 4️⃣ **CSS-tyylit** - theme.css

```css
/* Collection Filters */
.collection-filters {
  background: #f8f9fa;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.collection-filters ul {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.collection-filters li {
  margin: 0;
}

.collection-filters a {
  color: #666;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  display: block;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
}

.collection-filters a:hover {
  background: #e9ecef;
  color: #333;
}

.collection-filters a[aria-current="true"] {
  background: #39FF14;
  color: #000;
  border-color: #39FF14;
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* Product Grid */
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

/* Pagination */
.pagination {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 30px 0;
}

.pagination a {
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #333;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.pagination a:hover {
  background: #f8f9fa;
}

.pagination .current {
  background: #39FF14;
  color: #000;
  border-color: #39FF14;
}
```

## 5️⃣ **Tuotetagit Shopify Adminissa:**

**Lisää nämä tagit tuotteille:**
- `focus` - Focus & Energy tuotteet
- `calm` - Calm & Balance tuotteet  
- `sleep` - Sleep & Recovery tuotteet
- `accessories` - Botanical Accessories

